cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Multi-Foundation Model Benchmark for Bulk RNA-seq Deconvolution"
authors:
  - family-names: "Ye"
    given-names: "Rui"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-25"
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
keywords:
  - deconvolution
  - single-cell
  - bulk RNA-seq
  - benchmark
  - foundation model
repository-code: "https://github.com/RainyEricYe/bulkgpt-deconvolution-benchmark"
url: "https://huggingface.co/datasets/bulkgpt-data"
abstract: >-
  A standardized, reproducible benchmark for bulk RNA-seq deconvolution,
  evaluating 73 methods across 42 datasets (30 pseudo-bulk + 12 real-bulk),
  covering classical regression, container-based deconvolution, single-cell
  foundation-model frozen embeddings, fine-tuned foundation models, and ML
  regressor baselines.
